# Ennis, Debate Moderator: "if one or more cards were put into exile this turn". On turn 3 Bot1 casts Rejoinder, the copy of
# Elite Interceptor's prepare spell (CR 722), and Bot2 counters it with Force of Negation, which exiles it. A copy of a card is
# not a card (CR 707.12, 111.1, 108.2) and ceases to exist in exile, so no card was put into exile and Ennis gets no counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ennis, Debate Moderator
Elite Interceptor
Mox Pearl x5
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire x3
Force of Negation
Island x16

